Embedded fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
------------------------------------------
Every SVG ephemvis renders embeds a small astrology font so charts render
identically on any device. That font ("Astroglyphs 2K") is built from the
Google **Noto** fonts by the `astroglyphs_2K` toolkit and vendored
into `src/ephemvis/_fontdata.py` at build time. They are NOT MIT-licensed — they
are distributed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (see LICENSES/OFL.txt).

The font is renamed per the OFL Reserved Font Name clause ("Astroglyphs 2K")
and derives from:

    Noto Sans Symbols    (Version 2.003)
    Noto Sans Symbols 2  (Version 2.008)
    Noto Sans Math       (Version 3.000)
    Noto Sans            (Version 2.015)

